id the store page promise?"}</strong>{" Write it down in the words the store page uses."}</li><li><strong>{"What is the smallest real version of it?"}</strong>{" One task, one message, one invoice sent."}</li><li><strong>{"What can wait?"}</strong>{" Anything that is not needed for that moment moves later, or goes."}</li></ol><aside className={"custom-takeaways"} aria-label={"Key takeaways"}><p className={"custom-takeaways-title"}>{"Key takeaways"}</p><ul><li>{"Measure onboarding by the first real outcome, not by screens finished."}</li><li>{"Ask for data at the moment it is needed, never before."}</li><li>{"Test at the hour people really sign up. For Tendwell, that was 10 PM."}</li></ul></aside><p>{"Three months after release, 78% of new caregivers finished the first run, up from 41%. The tour we had planned never shipped. Nobody missed it."}</p></div><div className={"custom-author mx-auto mt-16 max-w-[44rem]"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/400x400.svg"} alt={""} width={"400"} height={"400"} className={"size-16 flex-none rounded-full object-cover"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /><div><p className={"m-0 font-semibold"}>{"Written by Ezra Ridley"}</p><p className={"mt-1 mb-0 text-soft"}>{"Independent product designer in Portland. I write one note a month about what the work taught me."}</p><a href={"#page=demo-product-designer-1-about"} className={"mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-primary-ink"}>{"About Ezra"}<i className={"ph ph-arrow-right"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></div></div></div></article><section id={"pd1-related"} className={"custom-wash py-(--section-space)"} aria-labelledby={"pd1-related-title"}><div className={"container"}><h2 id={"pd1-related-title"} className={"custom-h2 m-0"} data-anim={"fade-up"}>{"Keep reading"}</h2><div className={"mt-[clamp(2.5rem,2rem+2vw,4rem)] grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-3"}><article className={"custom-post group relative"}